{"format":"sylvinia-studio-ca","version":1,"module":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva","file":"chronique-alternative/source/src/rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva.ts","hash":"c2a9ba7a3bf8af3e","label":"Allenna × Lineva · rhythm bubbles","group":"Allenna × Lineva","scenes":[{"key":"§ALLENNA_LINEVA_RHYTHM_BUBBLES","title":"","section":"ALLENNA_LINEVA_RHYTHM_BUBBLES","used":true}],"items":[{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s0wz2mxa","k":"s","text":"Jeu de rythme à trois","sc":0,"line":19,"role":"title"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s18okl25","k":"s","text":"Trois cadences, un seul fil. Lineva donne des ordres (la piste pulse en bleu, le tempo accélère), Allenna s'arrête parfois au bord : ne touchez à rien. Quand l'une atteint son sommet, tenez la note jusqu'au bout : la scène continue.","sc":0,"line":20,"role":"instruction"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s1ut98tp","k":"s","text":"Trois sommets, un seul fil","sc":0,"line":30,"role":"title"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s0xtsok1","k":"s","text":"Score incontestable. Pour une fois.","sc":0,"line":30,"sp":"Lineva","role":"text"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s0g3pk5r","k":"s","text":"Ne dites surtout rien.","sc":0,"line":30,"sp":"Allenna","role":"text"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s09donaj","k":"s","text":"Égalité à trois","sc":0,"line":31,"role":"title"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s019cof0","k":"s","text":"Égalité. On recommencera.","sc":0,"line":31,"sp":"Allenna","role":"text"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s1ds8a4a","k":"s","text":"Revanche à trois","sc":0,"line":32,"role":"title"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s17spxgv","k":"s","text":"Repos. On reprendra l'exercice.","sc":0,"line":32,"sp":"Lineva","role":"text"},{"id":"rhythm-bubbles-allenna-lineva:s037lc0t","k":"s","text":"Lineva déteste l'à-peu-près : votre lien avec elle en garde la trace. Allenna, elle, réclame seulement une revanche.","sc":0,"line":34,"role":"relationNote"}],"arrays":[{"id":"rhythm-bubbles